EXECUTIVE SUMMARY:

This application is for an annexation located east of Pennsylvania Ave, between 13th Street and
Atlantic Drive. Growth into this area by the City is supported by PlanCheyenne, evidenced by its
classification as Urban Residential and its being located within the City of Cheyenne Urban Service
Boundary. With the subject property being about 35% contiguous with current City Limits on its west
side, this parcel is a natural, geographic, and social part of Cheyenne. If this application is approved, all
City services available to current City residents would be available to this subject property.

Due to meeting criteria set forth in Wyoming Statue § 14-1-102, staff recommends approval
of this annexation.

PlanCheyenne:

PlanCheyenne recognizes the growth potential in this area of the city and thus has identified it as
Urban Residential. Within areas designated as Urban Residential, a wide variety of housing types are
recommended for use, ranging from single-family housing to apartments and condos. Since the area is
located within the Urban Service Boundary, the City of Cheyenne has planned for this area to become
part of the City.
